@AgriStore.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5274
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@purchaseOrderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@purchaseOrderDetailId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@token = paste-jwt-token-here

### Danh sách user
GET {{AgriStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=20&search=&isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Chi tiết user
GET {{AgriStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Cập nhật user
PUT {{AgriStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
	"email": "user@example.com",
	"phoneNumber": "0900000000",
	"avatar": "https://example.com/avatar.png"
}

### Khóa user
PATCH {{AgriStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"isActive": false
}

### Mở khóa user
PATCH {{AgriStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"isActive": true
}

### Thêm sản phẩm vào đơn nhập
POST {{AgriStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-orders/{{purchaseOrderId}}/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"productId": "{{productId}}",
	"quantity": 10,
	"unitPrice": 25000
}

### Xác nhận đơn nhập (Draft -> Ordered)
POST {{AgriStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-orders/{{purchaseOrderId}}/order
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Nhận hàng một lần (Ordered -> Received; số thực nhận có thể thấp hơn số đặt)
POST {{AgriStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-orders/{{purchaseOrderId}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "details": [
    {
      "detailId": "{{purchaseOrderDetailId}}",
      "receivedQuantity": 8
    }
  ]
}

### Xóa sản phẩm khỏi đơn nhập
DELETE {{AgriStore.Api_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-orders/{{purchaseOrderId}}/details/{{purchaseOrderDetailId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
